  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Soak up the sunshine at 'Soakin It Up' ~ a newly renovated home on 30A in Inlet Beach. This 5 bdrm, 4.5 bath home sits between Rosemary Beach and Inlet Beach with beach access just a 5 min walk away. Location. Location. Location: Take the bikes up to 30Avenue for great food, shopping, and events, or stroll to Rosemary Beach! Features we love > three levels with sweeping balcony views, shuffleboard, hot tub, plus complimentary bikes. The living room, kitchen, and were all just remodeled! <br><br>Highlights ▶ <br>- Premier location - walkable to beach, Rosemary, and restaurants and shopping on 30 Avenue. <br>- 4 Complimentary Bikes <br>- Outdoor Oasis > between fenced in backyard and 2 balconies, there is plenty to explore and experience outdoor living <br>- ⭐Brand new⭐ private hot tub. <br>- Grill and outdoor dining on back deck, as well as upstairs on the balcony <br>- 5 min to Wall St Beach Access point <br>- 5 bedrooms + 4.5 bathrooms - EVERY bedroom has an En Suite Bathroom and all were just remodeled! <br>- Game room with an arcade game and shuffleboard <br><br>Head inside ▶ <br>- You'll enter into an open concept living / kitchen / dining area. Plenty of seating for your family, with a dining area for 8. <br>- Large kitchen island makes it a central gathering space with island seating for 4. Kitchen was just remodeled and refreshed with all new countertops, cabinets, and modern finishes. <br>- Vacation mode runs on coffee - we have a Keurig with complimentary coffee pods. <br>- 3 levels to explore! A second living room lives on the top floor, as well as a game area with shuffleboard and an arcade game. <br>- Outdoor balcony at every level - views of pool and tree top wraparound views to soak up the sunshine <br>- ⭐️ NEW ⭐️ Fun perks now available for Kalos' guests. Now offering, 20% off all Sculpt Studio classes at the Big Chill. Contact us for details!<br><br>Where you'll sleep ▶ <br>- First Floor Primary > Queen bed with extra seating, smart TV, ceiling fan. En suite also features a soaking tub, double vanity, and walk-in shower. <br>- Second Floor Guest room > Bunk room that is perfect for the kids. 3 Twin beds and a Double bed - sleeps 5! This room features a en suite Jack and Jill style with a shower and tub combo. <br>- Second Floor Guest room > Queen bed with shared en suite, Jack and Jill style with the bunk room. <br>- Second Floor Primary > King bedroom with a lot of space! Natural light, extra-large closet, smart TV, and en suite bathroom. <br>- Third Floor Guest room > 5th bedroom delights with another bunk bed, Twin over Double. This room also includes an en suite shower/tub combo. <br><br>Included with your stay ▶<br>- We provide a starter kit for all your basics. Paper towels, toilet paper, dish soap, laundry and dish pods <br>- All bathrooms come fully equipped with Public Goods hand soap, lotion, body wash, shampoo, and conditioner <br>- The community pool is directly across from the home. Loungers and tables invite you sit and hang awhile! <br>- Beach access is a 5 min walk to Wall St Access point. Bike or take the golf cart there too! <br>- We've got you covered on beach gear too. We provide beach towels, chairs, and an umbrella for easy breezy beach trips. <br>- 4 bikes <br>⭐There is a Golf Cart available to rent at the home. South Walton Carts is the exclusive vendor for golf cart rentals at this property. They offer highly discounted rates to guests staying at this property. During the reservation process, we'll connect you to ensure you can secure your rental.<br><br>Other things to note: <br>- Parking: 4 spots in the driveway, no street parking is available in this community. <br>- The word is out! 30A is one of Florida's best vacation spots. Unfortunately, more visitors means less parking options. Additional parking spaces are the responsibility of the renter. We recommend looking into nearby storage facilities who offer long term parking options in their lots.<br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25.<br>- Apologies, no furry friends are allowed at the home. We appreciate your understanding on this.<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi or construction on 30A. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters. <br><br> STR24-038428",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
